          .num_remark
            %h6#remark Remark
            %p
              Instead of the site
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/CartSp"} CartSp
              of def.
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#Smooth0Types"}
              one could use the site
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/SmoothMfd"} SmoothMfd
              of all smooth manifolds. All of the statements and constructions in the following go through in that case just as well. In fact
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/CartSp"} CartSp
              is a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/dense+subsite"} dense subsite
              of
              = succeed "." do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/SmoothMfd"} SmoothMfd
