              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/stalks"} stalks
              of sheaves over smooth manifolds are evaluations on small
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/open+balls"} open balls
              and since every open ball is
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/diffeomorphism"} diffeomorphic
              to a Cartesian space, many statements that are true (only) stalkwise over
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/SmoothMfd"} SmoothMfd
