          .proof
            %h6#proof_4 Proof
            %p
              That the diagram commutes is a straightforward inspection, unwinding the definitions. That
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msub
                      %mover
                        %mi ch
                        %mo ^
                      %mo •
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \widehat{ch}_\bullet
              is a fibration according to def.
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#FibrantOnjectStructureOnChSmooth"}
              is by its very construction, being a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/projection"} projection
              in positive degree. That the left morphism is a weak equivalence comes down to the
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Poincar%C3%A9+lemma"} Poincaré lemma
              = succeed "." do
                %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#TheDeRhamResolutionOfConstantFunctions"}
