              The first statement is what gives the name to “
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/differential+cohomology"}> differential cohomology
              ” as it makes precise how
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
